			"notes": "# Maid Logistics Network 1.4.4\n\n## Optional Dependencies\n\n- Touhou Little Maid: Spell and Cloth Config are now optional. Either mod, or both, may be omitted.\n- Without Touhou Little Maid: Spell, Ender Pocket remote integration is disabled. Walking, broom transport, and other independent features remain available.\n- Without Cloth Config, extension settings screens are hidden. Existing settings or default values remain active.\n\n## Fixes Retained\n\n- Restores the 1.4.2 terminal map fix for narrow windows and high GUI scales, including narrower control panels and buttons.\n- Retains the completed/unsuccessful request-list redispatch fix and recovery of stale in-transit request lists, preserving their request data and original delivery targets.\n\n## Installation\n\n- Install the Forge file only on Minecraft 1.20.1, or the NeoForge file only on Minecraft 1.21.1.\n- Update the extension on both the client and server.\n- Touhou Little Maid and Maid Storage Manager remain required.\n\n## Source Code\n\n- Forge 1.20.1: [`forge/1.20.1`](https://github.com/hzbj/maid-storage-manager-extension/tree/forge/1.20.1), release tag [`v1.4.4`](https://github.com/hzbj/maid-storage-manager-extension/tree/v1.4.4).\n- NeoForge 1.21.1: [`neoforge/1.21.1`](https://github.com/hzbj/maid-storage-manager-extension/tree/neoforge/1.21.1), release tag [`v1.4.4-neoforge-1.21.1`](https://github.com/hzbj/maid-storage-manager-extension/tree/v1.4.4-neoforge-1.21.1).\n\nThe built-in source archives on this release correspond to Forge. Use the NeoForge release tag above for the NeoForge source code."
		},
